"body": {"content": [{"endIndex": 1, "sectionBreak": {"sectionStyle": {"columnSeparatorStyle": "NONE", "contentDirection": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "sectionType": "CONTINUOUS"}}}, {"endIndex": 13, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 13, "startIndex": 1, "textRun": {"content": "Nos valeurs\n", "textStyle": {"bold": true, "fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "underline": true, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spaceAbove": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "spaceBelow": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 1}, {"endIndex": 421, "paragraph": {"bullet": {"listId": "kix.pz6gk48tyeva", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}, "elements": [{"endIndex": 37, "startIndex": 13, "textRun": {"content": "L'égalité des chances : ", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}, {"endIndex": 421, "startIndex": 37, "textRun": {"content": "Nous faisons en sorte que nos membres disposent des mêmes chances,  des mêmes opportunités de développement social, indépendamment de leur origine sociale ou ethnique, de leur sexe, de leur âge, de leur moyens financiers, d’une maladie ou encore d’un éventuel handicap. Il s’agit de permettre à chacun de disposer des mêmes chances pour accéder au monde sportif et a une vie active. \n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "indentFirstLine": {"magnitude": 18, "unit": "PT"}, "indentStart": {"magnitude": 36, "unit": "PT"}, "lineSpacing": 100, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 13}, {"endIndex": 422, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 422, "startIndex": 421, "textRun": {"content": "\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 100, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 421}, {"endIndex": 423, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 423, "startIndex": 422, "textRun": {"content": "\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "indentFirstLine": {"magnitude": 36, "unit": "PT"}, "indentStart": {"magnitude": 36, "unit": "PT"}, "lineSpacing": 100, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 422}, {"endIndex": 750, "paragraph": {"bullet": {"listId": "kix.pz6gk48tyeva", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}, "elements": [{"endIndex": 750, "startIndex": 423, "textRun": {"content": "Le bien-être : la santé mentale et physique n'a pas de prix .Dans notre combat, nous reconnaissons qu'un bon moral et une bonne humeur peuvent être des atouts primordiaux nous permettant d'avancer. Pour permettre cela, Figthxlife poursuit l'objectif de favoriser le développement personnel, physique et social de ses membres. \n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "indentFirstLine": {"magnitude": 18, "unit": "PT"}, "indentStart": {"magnitude": 36, "unit": "PT"}, "lineSpacing": 100, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 423}, {"endIndex": 751, "paragraph": {"elements": [{"endIndex": 751, "startIndex": 750, "textRun": {"content": "\n", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "lineSpacing": 100, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 750}, {"endIndex": 1099, "paragraph": {"bullet": {"listId": "kix.pz6gk48tyeva", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}, "elements": [{"endIndex": 1098, "startIndex": 751, "textRun": {"content": "La solidarité : elle est cette main tendue vers l'autre pour lui rappeler qu'il n'est pas seul dans ce qu'il traverse. Dans un esprit marqué par le respect, tenant compte de l'évolution de chacun selon son propre rythme, l'association Fightxlife souhaite renforcer les liens sociaux et offrir un lieu de rencontres sécurisant, loin de la solitude.", "textStyle": {"fontSize": {"magnitude": 12, "unit": "PT"}, "foregroundColor": {"color": {"rgbColor": {"blue": 0.08235294, "green": 0.08235294, "red": 0.08235294}}}, "weightedFontFamily": {"fontFamily": "Calibri", "weight": 400}}}}, {"endIndex": 1099, "startIndex": 1098, "textRun": {"content": "\n", "textStyle": {}}}], "paragraphStyle": {"direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT", "indentFirstLine": {"magnitude": 18, "unit": "PT"}, "indentStart": {"magnitude": 36, "unit": "PT"}, "lineSpacing": 100, "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT", "spacingMode": "NEVER_COLLAPSE"}}, "startIndex": 751}]},
